    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Baby, Child, Teenage \\u0026 Adult Circumcision in Birmingham\",\"title\":\"Circumcision in Birmingham\",\"lede\":\"Beverley Clinic provides circumcision for babies, children, teenagers and adults from Birmingham and the surrounding areas.\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Visit us\",\"href\":\"/contact/\"},{\"label\":\"Birmingham\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our main circumcision clinic is Beverley Clinic in Edgware, North-West London, where we provide our regular circumcision service.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>For patients who specifically want their circumcision performed in Birmingham, we can arrange the procedure at clinical premises in Birmingham.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"className\":\"wp-block-heading display d-3\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading display d-3\">Birmingham Circumcision Location</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Soho Health Centre</strong><br>Louise Road<br>Handsworth<br>Birmingham<br>B21 9RY</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Because the Birmingham clinical facilities are arranged specifically for the patient's appointment, having the procedure in Birmingham costs more than attending our main clinic in Edgware.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If you would prefer the more economical option, you are welcome to attend our main London clinic instead.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Please contact us to discuss a Birmingham circumcision appointment, availability and the arrangements for you or your child.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#enquire\">Enquire about Birmingham circumcision</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/contact/\">View our London clinic</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-navy\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"patients-from-birmingham\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-navy\" id=\"patients-from-birmingham\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Circumcision for Patients from Birmingham\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"Patients from Birmingham and the surrounding West Midlands have two options when choosing Beverley Clinic.\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-2\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Have the circumcision in Birmingham\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eIf you specifically want the procedure performed in Birmingham, we can arrange your circumcision at:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSoho Health Centre\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLouise Road\\u003cbr\\u003eHandsworth\\u003cbr\\u003eBirmingham\\u003cbr\\u003eB21 9RY\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe arrange the clinical facilities specifically for the patient\\u0026#039;s appointment. For this reason, having the procedure in Birmingham costs more than attending our main clinic in Edgware.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ePlease contact us for availability and further information.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Contact us about Birmingham\",\"ctaUrl\":\"#enquire\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn\"},{\"title\":\"Attend our main clinic in Edgware\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eAlternatively, patients can travel to our main Beverley Clinic in Edgware, North-West London.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis is where we provide our regular circumcision service and is the more economical option for patients who are happy to travel to London.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eBeverley Clinic\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e78 Beverley Drive\\u003cbr\\u003eEdgware\\u003cbr\\u003eNorth-West London\\u003cbr\\u003eHA8 5NE\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"View our London clinic\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/contact/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn\",\"cta2Label\":\"Get directions\",\"cta2Url\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1\\u0026query=78%20Beverley%20Drive%2C%20Edgware%20HA8%205NE\",\"cta2Class\":\"btn btn-ghost\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"all-ages\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"all-ages\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Circumcision in Birmingham for All Ages\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"We provide circumcision for babies, toddlers, children, teenagers and adults.\"} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The method used is selected according to the patient's age, anatomy, foreskin development, reason for circumcision and individual circumstances.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-3\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Baby Circumcision in Birmingham\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe regularly perform circumcision for newborn babies and infants.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFor babies and younger children where clinically suitable, we may use a Plastibell or Circumplast ring technique.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eParents receive preparation information before the appointment together with detailed guidance about caring for their baby following circumcision.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Baby circumcision \u2192\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/babies/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"},{\"title\":\"Child \\u0026 Teenage Circumcision in Birmingham\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe provide circumcision for younger children, older children and teenagers for religious, cultural, personal and medical reasons.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe circumcision technique depends on the child\\u0026#039;s age, anatomy and individual circumstances.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Child \\u0026 teenage circumcision \u2192\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/children/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"},{\"title\":\"Adult Circumcision in Birmingham\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eAdults can contact us about circumcision for personal, religious, cultural or medical reasons.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFor older patients, we commonly use a forceps-guided circumcision technique with thermal cautery.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWound closure may involve dissolvable stitches, medical skin glue, a combination of the two or occasionally neither, depending on the individual procedure.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Adult circumcision \u2192\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/adults/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-navy\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"medical-circumcision\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-navy\" id=\"medical-circumcision\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Medical Circumcision in Birmingham\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"We also see patients from Birmingham and the West Midlands who require circumcision because of a medical or foreskin problem.\"} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>This includes patients with:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-2\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Phimosis\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA tight or scarred foreskin that cannot be comfortably retracted.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Read about phimosis \u2192\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/conditions/phimosis/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"},{\"title\":\"Recurrent Balanitis\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eRepeated episodes of inflammation affecting the foreskin and glans.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Read about balanitis \u2192\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/conditions/balanitis/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"},{\"title\":\"BXO / Lichen Sclerosis\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA condition that can cause whitening, tightening and progressive scarring of the foreskin.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Read about BXO / lichen sclerosis \u2192\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/conditions/bxo/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"},{\"title\":\"Other foreskin problems\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eIf you have a foreskin problem and are unsure whether circumcision is appropriate, contact us and explain the problem so that we can advise you about the appropriate appointment.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"32px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\" style=\"margin-top:32px\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>For the foreskin conditions we treat surgically at Beverley Clinic, circumcision is the treatment we provide.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"religious-and-cultural\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"religious-and-cultural\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Religious \\u0026 Cultural Circumcision in Birmingham\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"We welcome families and adult patients from Birmingham and the surrounding areas seeking circumcision for religious or cultural reasons.\"} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our focus is on providing circumcision in an appropriate clinical environment, with clear information before the procedure and detailed aftercare afterwards.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/religious/\">Religious &amp; cultural circumcision \u2192</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-navy\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"why-patients-choose-us\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-navy\" id=\"why-patients-choose-us\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Why Patients Choose Beverley Clinic\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-3\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Circumcision is a core part of our clinical work\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eCircumcision is part of our day-to-day clinical work, rather than an occasional procedure.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOur practitioners have extensive experience in circumcision and have also trained doctors from the UK and abroad in circumcision techniques and patient care.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Babies, children, teenagers and adults\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe provide circumcision across a wide range of ages, from babies through to adults.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Individual approach\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe do not use the same circumcision method for every patient.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe appropriate technique is selected according to factors including age, anatomy, foreskin development, reason for circumcision and findings on examination.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Preparation and aftercare\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003ePatients and parents receive preparation information before treatment and detailed written aftercare afterwards.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Follow-up care\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eOur care does not simply finish when the patient leaves.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe provide support during the healing period and can arrange an in-person review where required.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAny in-person follow-up appointments following a Birmingham procedure take place at our main Beverley Clinic in Edgware.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Trusted by patients and parents\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eThousands of patients and parents have shared feedback about their experience of Beverley Clinic through Google, Trustpilot, Yell and feedback sent directly to the clinic.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eMany new patients also come to us following recommendations from previous patients, family members and friends.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Read patient reviews \u2192\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/testimonials/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"our-approach\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"our-approach\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Our Approach to Circumcision\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-2\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Plastibell \\u0026 Circumplast Circumcision\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eFor babies and younger children where clinically suitable, we may use a Plastibell or Circumplast ring method.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe ring remains in place following the procedure and normally separates naturally during healing.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eParents receive detailed aftercare instructions explaining how to care for the circumcision at home.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Forceps-Guided Circumcision\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eFor older children, teenagers and adults, we commonly use a forceps-guided circumcision technique with thermal cautery.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe wound may be managed using dissolvable stitches, medical skin glue, a combination of the two or occasionally neither depending on the individual procedure.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /--><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/\">Learn more about circumcision \u2192</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-warm\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"follow-up\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-warm\" id=\"follow-up\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Follow-Up After Circumcision in Birmingham\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If you choose to have the procedure in Birmingham, your circumcision will take place at:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Soho Health Centre</strong><br>Louise Road<br>Handsworth<br>Birmingham<br>B21 9RY</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>However, Beverley Clinic in Edgware is our main clinical base and follow-up clinic.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If an in-person review or follow-up appointment is required after your circumcision, you will need to attend:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Beverley Clinic</strong><br>78 Beverley Drive<br>Edgware<br>North-West London<br>HA8 5NE</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Patients and parents should take this into consideration when deciding whether to arrange the procedure in Birmingham or attend our Edgware clinic from the beginning.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>You will still receive the appropriate preparation information, aftercare guidance and support following your procedure.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/aftercare/\">Aftercare information \u2192</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"birmingham-or-edgware\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"birmingham-or-edgware\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Birmingham or Edgware \u2013 Which Should I Choose?\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-2\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Choose Birmingham if:\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYou specifically want the circumcision to take place in Birmingham and are happy for us to arrange clinical premises for your appointment.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAs the facilities have to be arranged specifically for the appointment, the Birmingham option has a higher cost.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Choose Edgware if:\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYou are happy to travel to our main circumcision clinic in North-West London and would prefer the more economical option.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eEdgware is our main clinic, where we regularly provide circumcision and where any required in-person follow-up takes place.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"32px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\" style=\"margin-top:32px\"><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#enquire\">Ask about Birmingham</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/contact/\">View Edgware clinic</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/faq {\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions About Circumcision in Birmingham\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Can I have a circumcision in Birmingham?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. If you specifically want your or your child's circumcision performed in Birmingham, we can arrange the procedure at Soho Health Centre, Louise Road, Handsworth, Birmingham, B21 9RY.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Where is your Birmingham circumcision location?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eCircumcision appointments in Birmingham can be arranged at:\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003eSoho Health Centre, Louise Road, Handsworth, Birmingham, B21 9RY.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Is Birmingham your main circumcision clinic?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eNo. Our main clinic is Beverley Clinic in Edgware, North-West London.\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003eFor patients who specifically want circumcision in Birmingham, we can arrange suitable clinical premises at Soho Health Centre.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Why does circumcision in Birmingham cost more?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eOur main clinical facilities are based in Edgware.\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003eFor a Birmingham appointment, we arrange and hire suitable clinical premises specifically for the patient's procedure. This means the cost is higher than attending our regular Edgware clinic.\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003ePlease contact us for further information.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Can I travel to your London clinic instead?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. Patients from Birmingham and the West Midlands are welcome to attend our main clinic at 78 Beverley Drive, Edgware, HA8 5NE.\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003eThis is the more economical option if you are happy to travel to London.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Where will my follow-up appointment take place?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eAny required in-person follow-up appointment following a circumcision performed in Birmingham will take place at our main Beverley Clinic in Edgware.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Do you provide baby circumcision in Birmingham?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. We provide circumcision for newborn babies and infants.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Do you provide child and teenage circumcision in Birmingham?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. We provide circumcision for younger children, older children and teenagers.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Do you provide adult circumcision in Birmingham?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. Adults can contact us about circumcision for personal, religious, cultural or medical reasons.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Do you provide circumcision for phimosis and other foreskin problems?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. We provide circumcision for medical and foreskin problems including phimosis, recurrent balanitis and BXO / lichen sclerosis.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"enquire\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"enquire\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Enquire About Circumcision in Birmingham\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"If you live in Birmingham or the surrounding West Midlands, you can choose between having the procedure arranged in Birmingham or travelling to our main Beverley Clinic in Edgware.\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-2\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Birmingham\",\"html\":\"<p><strong>Soho Health Centre</strong><br>Louise Road<br>Handsworth<br>Birmingham<br>B21 9RY</p><p>Clinical facilities are arranged specifically for your appointment, so this option has a higher cost.</p>\"},{\"title\":\"Main Beverley Clinic \u2013 Edgware\",\"html\":\"<p><strong>Beverley Clinic</strong><br>78 Beverley Drive<br>Edgware<br>North-West London<br>HA8 5NE</p><p>Our Edgware clinic is the more economical option and is also where any required in-person follow-up appointments take place.</p>\"}]} /--><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>When contacting us, please tell us:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"cil-checklist\"} --><ul class=\"cil-checklist wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>The patient's age</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>The reason for circumcision</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Whether you prefer Birmingham or Edgware</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Whether there is a medical or foreskin problem</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#birmingham\">Enquire about Birmingham circumcision</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/contact/\">View Edgware clinic</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/testimonials/\">Read patient reviews</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band {\"title\":\"If you have further questions\",\"text\":\"<p>If you have further questions, you can either <a href=\\\"tel:+442089513794\\\">call us</a> or <a href=\\\"#request-callback\\\">request for us to call you back</a>. You can also send us an email enquiry or speak to us via Whatsapp.</p><p class=\\\"cil-cta-contacts\\\"><a class=\\\"cil-cta-contact cil-cta-contact--email\\\" href=\\\"mailto:info@circumcisioninlondon.co.uk\\\"><span class=\\\"cil-cta-contact__label\\\">Email</span>info@circumcisioninlondon.co.uk</a><a class=\\\"cil-cta-contact cil-cta-contact--whatsapp\\\" href=\\\"https://wa.me/447886779958\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" data-track=\\\"whatsapp-cta\\\"><span class=\\\"cil-cta-contact__label\\\">WhatsApp</span>07886779958</a></p>\",\"eyebrow\":\"Talk to us\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Book online\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/book/\",\"phoneLabel\":\"Call 020 8951 3794\",\"phoneUrl\":\"tel:+442089513794\",\"cardTitle\":\"\",\"cardHtml\":\"\",\"cardEyebrow\":\"Request a call back\",\"showCallback\":true,\"formId\":\"birmingham\",\"formSubject\":\"Birmingham circumcision enquiry\",\"callbackAnchor\":\"request-callback\",\"nameLabel\":\"Your name\",\"phoneFieldLabel\":\"Phone number\",\"dobLabel\":\"Patient DOB\",\"messageLabel\":\"Anything you would like us to know\",\"optionalLabel\":\"(optional)\",\"consentHtml\":\"I am happy for the clinic to contact me about this enquiry. We do not add you to a mailing list. See our <a href=\\\"/privacy-notice/\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--blue-deep)\\\">privacy notice</a>.\",\"submitLabel\":\"Request a call back\",\"invalidMessage\":\"Please complete the highlighted field.\",\"sentMessage\":\"Opening your email app so this reaches the clinic. If nothing happens, call 020 8951 3794.\"} /-->",
